# Synthetic scenario (№49 coverage): pause/inventory item interaction.
# Built on the level1.inp prefix (frames <3580 — title skip; world state
# identical to the level1 replay). Long holds: the [3B8] input-word gates
# sample once per frame and some consumers add a %4 frame gate.
#
# Exercises v2_pause_items_11cbb mode 1 branches (sub_11BA5 loop, TAB entry):
#   LCTRL ×2   — viking switch (v2_pause_switch_viking: sub_120D1 selector
#                renders + sub_11F47 distance gates + SFX 1);
#   RIGHT ×2   — cursor move + the SECOND press hits the "already there"
#                path: №49-fix's UNCONDITIONAL erase-old (sub_1183d) fires
#                with no cursor change;
#   DOWN ×2, LEFT, UP — remaining arrows incl. one more "at edge" press;
#   F          — pickup on the level-1 start slot (EMPTY: sub_121B9 empty
#                path + UNCONDITIONAL sub_120D1 commit);
#   TAB        — 0x3000 exit path (blink=0x11 + leave the menu).
# Mode-0 branches (Action/Exit while CARRYING an item) need a level with an
# item actually picked up — requires a human-recorded replay (see
# SCENARIOS.md `inventory`); the start inventory on level 1 is empty.
